      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "MVが公開されました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "MV 公开啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The MV has been released."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "すこし久しぶりの動画ですね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "感觉有一阵子没发视频了呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's been a little while since my last video."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "感想がなによりの元気の源だとしみじみ\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "8ca24e2a3a95.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00093.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "深深觉得，大家的感想才是我最大的元气来源"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm deeply reminded that your feedback is the greatest source of my energy"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "居場所でいてくれてありがとう。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "谢谢你们一直给我一个可以安放自己的地方。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Thank you for being a place where I belong."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そして、私もみんなの居場所になれますように。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "同时，也希望我也能成为大家的归属之地。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And may I become a place where you belong, too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
